{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨晚（29日）11時許，一名35歲李姓男子和家人失去聯絡，家人懷疑李男在沙田大圍秦石邨石玉樓住所暈倒，於是報案。</p><p>救護員接報到場，發現李男倒臥在上址，證實事主當場死亡，事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主在沙田大圍秦石邨石玉樓住所暈倒，當場不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192669959247892480257816.jpeg/bOIYg-5bLBVEMlamvQSRMGffSe_TWYrjPdMVJgfTFSY\"/><figcaption>事主在沙田大圍秦石邨石玉樓住所暈倒，當場不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T19:00:57.512746+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T18:55:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:31.401906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T18:58:30.606562+00:00","content_hash":"705be56603a2cbe892632df9735d3f74a3ddb5eea2115590e66e3d18593073de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}